  "bodyHash": "15501452c1919ad4",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n![](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png) \n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\">&nbsp;適用於 FORGE 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\">NEOFORGE 1.21.1</span></p>  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Integrated API（整合API）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Create（創世機）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Quark</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Supplementaries（補遺）</span></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>選用整合模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biomes O’ Plenty（豐饒生物群系）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Alex’s Mobs（艾利克斯的動物）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Guard Villagers（守衛村民）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Artifacts（神器）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biomes You'll Go（探索生物群系）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Regions Unexplored（未探明地區）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Terralith（大地岩層）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Waystones（傳送石）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Farmer's Delight（農夫樂事）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ice and Fire（冰與火之歌）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ars Nouveau（新藝魔法）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Better Archeology（更好的考古學）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\">![](https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg)</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\"><strong><strong>什麼是「整合地牢與結構」？</strong></strong></span></h2> <span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;「整合地牢與結構」（Integrated Dungeons and Structures，簡稱 IDAS）是一個透過 Quark、艾利克斯的動物與 Create 的方塊和生物，加入高度細緻結構的模組，並可選整合許多其他模組。我受夠了把各種結構模組裝進整合包後在世界裡漫遊，卻只看到原版物品、毫無挑戰性可言。我熱愛精緻的建築與 Create 機器，因此決定製作一個能完美補足我缺失的模組。這裡有充滿背景故事、美觀且具挑戰性的地牢與結構，並且已完全整合多款核心 Forge 模組。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">如果你是剛接觸本模組的新手，強烈建議尋找迷宮、工匠工坊、古代礦坑或掠奪者堡壘並通關體驗。這些結構花費了最多的時間打造，我認為它們確實非常有趣且富有成就感。祝你好運！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong>看看我的其他專案！</strong></span>\n\n* <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft（整合我的世界）</a>，IDAS 系列的官方整合包</strong></span>\n* <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #800080;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold（整合要塞）</a><br></strong></span>\n* <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #800080;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages（整合村莊）</a></strong></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>設定與選用整合：</strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>適用於 1.16</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">編輯設定檔<br>IDAS 會自動偵測是否安裝 Ice and Fire（冰與火之歌），並調整部分結構的戰利品與生物</span></p><p><br><strong>適用於 1.18 及以上版本</strong><br>要啟用 BOP（豐饒生物群系）整合，請下載此 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #36f; text-decoration: underline;\">數據包</span></span></a>。<br>要啟用 Alex's Mobs（艾利克斯的動物）整合，請下載此 <span style=\"color: #36f;\"><a style=\"color: #36f;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">數據包</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要設定其他選項，請下載此 <span style=\"color: #36f;\"><a style=\"color: #36f;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">數據包</a></span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要更改生成率，請在結構集設定中調整間距（Spacing）與分離距離（Separation）。間距是兩次鄰近生成嘗試之間的平均距離，數值介於 0 到 4096 之間<br>分離距離是兩次鄰近嘗試之間的最小距離（以區塊為單位），數值介於 0 到 4096 之間，且不能大於間距</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要編輯生物群系，請修改標籤文件中的 biome 檔案：tags/worldgen/biome/has structure</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要停用結構，請移除其標籤列表中的所有生物群系，或將分離距離與間距調至極高數值</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要提升與其他結構模組的相容性，請在各個 worldgen/configured_structure_feature 檔案的「避免生成的結構集」列表中新增結構</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>使用全域數據包模組時，若同時使用 BOP 與設定數據包，必須手動確保 BOP 整合數據包的載入順序位於設定數據包之上。</span></p></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>功能與未來規劃：</strong></strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>超過 50 種獨特且高度細緻的結構，分佈於主世界與下界，包含：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 20 種獨特的小型精緻世界建築結構，例如營地、市場、動物巢穴等</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 7 種終局等級地牢，規模從宏偉的矮人礦坑到沙漠迷宮再到掠奪者堡壘不等</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 結合 Create 主題的地牢，包含旋轉致命陷阱，例如工匠工坊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 15 種獨特的房屋與旅店，供疲憊的旅人歇息</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 6 座可供探索的魔法法師塔與附魔塔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 沉沒的海盜船</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 村民城堡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 下界中可供探索的魔法塔與傳送門</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 節慶/事件主題結構，例如冬季馬車與鬼屋莊園</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>未來規劃功能：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 地下地牢變體</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 更多下界與終界結構</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- <strong>加入我的 Discord 伺服器提出建議，並投票決定下一個新增的結構！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong>如果找不到這些結構，只需在聊天欄輸入 `<em>/locate idas</em>`，就會列出所有結構。例如，輸入 `<em>/locate idas:castle</em>` 即可找到離你最近的城堡。</strong></span></p></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>所有結構圖片</strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>強大的迷宮，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>掠奪者堡壘，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>古代礦坑，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>法師塔，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>附魔塔，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>廢棄房屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>城堡，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>磚造小屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鄉間小屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鬧鬼房屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>熊爪旅店，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>沉船，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>獵人木屋，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>農舍，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>女巫樹樁屋，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>隱士谷地，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>煉藥師居所，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>漁夫小屋，由 Nirze 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>紅角公會，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>養蜂人之家，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>樹冠酒吧，由 Howester1984 與 chloe2cu 設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>古代傳送門，由 CraisinLord 與 Nirze 設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>工匠工坊，由 CraisinLord 與 Howester1984 設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>死靈法師尖塔，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>市集，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>鬼屋莊園，由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>冬季馬車，由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>詭譎恐慍堡壘，由 CraisinLord 設計（僅 Ice and Fire）</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><br>樞紐，由 Codex 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">此結構的傳送門包含：<br></strong></strong></span></p><div><div><div><p>Aether（天空之境）</p><p>Twilight Forest（暮色森林）</p><p>Atum（埃及）</p><p>Nether（下界）</p><p>Erebus/Undergarden（厄瑞玻斯/地底花園）</p><p>Bumblezone（蜜蜂界）</p><p>Eden ring（伊甸環）</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>深海遺跡，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/508/2023-05-25_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>火車遺跡，由 brythonderoos 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/820/362/2024-03-07_00.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>冰封墓穴，由 Darth Trayus 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/834/984/2024-03-12_11.png\" width=\"586\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>挖掘工地，由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/364/2024-06-30_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>沙漠挖掘工地，由 Howester 1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/363/2024-07-01_16.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br>工匠堡壘，由 Darth Trayus 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/361/2024-07-01_13.png\" width=\"592\" height=\"317\"><br></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>大魔導師之塔，由 Cpt_Gloval 設計（需要 Ars Nouveau）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/362/2024-07-01_14.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"314\"><br></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>荒廢燈塔，由 Ghast 設計<br></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/88/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>收藏家博物館，由 Ghast 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/982/2025-03-17_19.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>風吹祭壇，由 Jawredstoneguy 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/983/2025-03-15_23.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"318\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>塞壬海灣，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/928/2026-03-20_14-55-57-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>植物學家工作室，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/912/2026-03-20_14-46-06-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>原木居所，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/913/2026-03-20_14-48-39-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>荒廢葡萄園，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/925/2026-03-20_14-53-35-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>毀壞教堂，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/929/2026-03-20_14-50-22-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>破損要塞，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/926/2026-03-20_14-54-33-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>枯井，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/927/2026-03-20_14-55-17-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>石匠小屋，由 Qwerty 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/930/2026-03-20_14-53-04-png.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>都鐸酒館，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/900/2026-03-20_14-16-24-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"460\"></strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>奇趣雜貨店，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/908/2026-03-20_14-17-45-png.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"442\"></strong></span></div></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>常見問題：</strong></strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：哪些生物群系模組相容？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：大多數生物群系模組皆相容，包含 Terralith、BOP 與 BYG。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：為什麼依賴模組這麼多？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：是的。</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：你會移植舊版或更新到 ___ 嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：只要依賴模組更新，我會持續讓本模組跟上新版 Minecraft。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：本模組能與其他結構模組共存嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：可以。Yung 的所有模組、Repurposed Structures 等都能無衝突運行。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：我可以將本模組用於整合包嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：當然！我很樂見本模組被用於整合包中。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：本模組能否僅安裝在伺服器端？<br>答：不行。由於它包含自訂音樂唱片與配樂，且修改了客戶端結構方塊，因此必須安裝於客戶端。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：想住在這些結構裡的玩家：如何阻止生物生成？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：試試看安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magnum Torch 模組</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">問：哪些 Quark 的功能可以關閉？&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：所有技術性變更與紅石功能皆可無縫關閉。不過 IDAS 仍會使用所有的建築方塊。</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">來看看 KaupenJoe 製作的超讚 IDAS 模組展示影片：</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>absolutely</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> amazing video mod showcase of IDAS by KaupenJoe:</strong></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5DU4DlTWQiw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"428\" width=\"428\"></iframe></strong></span>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/craisincraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #800080;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></span></p> <span style=\"color: #800080; font-size: 14px;\">我花了超過 300 小時搭建與編寫此模組的程式碼。我是為了這個專案才專門學習 Java 的。如果你非常喜歡我的作品，支持我的最佳方式有二：直接透過 Patreon 贊助，或是透過 Bisect Hosting 購買伺服器。點擊上方圖片即可獲得伺服器，使用優惠碼 CraisinCraft 可享首月 25% 折扣，與朋友們盡情遊玩吧！設定非常簡單，幾乎只要點擊一次。</span>\n\n<span style=\"color: #800080; font-size: 14px;\">點擊下方圖片前往我的 Patreon 頁面直接支持我。你將獲得專屬的 Discord 身份組、聊天權限，並能直接影響 IDAS 的開發方向。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #800080;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">特別感謝：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">我的 Patreon 贊助者們！！！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">Howester1984、Nirze 以及 IDAS 建築團隊，感謝你們建造了模組中眾多精美的結構！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">Cama，模組中驚人的音樂唱片作者</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/nighthearted/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nighthearted</a>，我借用了他們城堡建築的原始輪廓來製作掠奪者堡壘，但方塊配色、內部設計與所有細節均為我原創。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">Bisect Hosting 團隊，尤其是 Perz，感謝你們為本模組設計標誌！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">TelepathicGrunt（Repurposed Structures 作者），我在編碼時大量參考了他們的模組檔案。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">YUNGNICKYOUNG，感謝他的結構模板管理工具。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\">我的貓 Fonzy，編寫整個專案時一直坐在我的腿上。膝上的重量確實能幫助保持專注</span></p> &nbsp;<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">如果遇到任何問題或有建議，請點擊下方的圖片或連結加入 Discord 伺服器。我會盡力回覆每一位玩家，也非常歡迎提供建議！感謝遊玩並支持我的模組！</span> &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"> https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb</p>",
